archie-code
*.exe

# A bare `go build` (no -o) names the binary after the directory. The canonical
# artifact is `archie-code` (Makefile BINARY_NAME, README, install.sh) — this catches
# the mis-named one so a 9.4 MB build artifact stops showing up as untracked.
/archie-tui

# `make all` cross-compiles five platform binaries here (~34 MB). Only *.exe was
# caught before, so a release build left four untracked artifacts behind — the
# same class of problem #40 fixed for the mis-named single binary.
dist/
